---
const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'Do I need a domain name or SSL?',
    a: 'No. It works fine on a local IP or hostname inside your network. If you expose it publicly, put it behind a reverse proxy that handles SSL — Caddy or nginx both work well.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Do I need an account to view or edit a board?',
    a: 'No. Editing is granted by the full URL including its #token fragment. Viewing is granted by the URL without the fragment. There are no user accounts.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How do I back up my boards?',
    a: 'Back up the entire data/ directory. It contains boards.json (the directory), fridges/<slug>.json (board state), and uploads/ (image files). A simple tar -czf backup.tgz data covers all three.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can multiple people edit at the same time?',
    a: 'Changes from multiple editors are merged using patch operations. The last writer for any individual item wins. It handles concurrent household use well — it is not built for real-time collaborative document editing.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What happens if I forget the admin token?',
    a: 'If you did not set SELFHOST_ADMIN_TOKEN via env, a token was auto-generated and saved to data/.admin-token on first startup. Retrieve it with: cat ./data/.admin-token',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can I run it on a Raspberry Pi?',
    a: 'Yes. The server is plain Node.js with no native addons. Multi-architecture Docker images are available. A Pi 4 with 2GB RAM is more than enough for household use.',
  },
];
---
<section id="faq" class="border-t border-rule px-6 py-20 sm:py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <div class="grid gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[220px_1fr]">
      <div class="lg:pt-1">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted">FAQ</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">
          Common<br/>questions
        </h2>
      </div>

      <dl class="divide-y divide-rule">
        {faqs.map((faq) => (
          <div class="py-7">
            <dt class="font-display text-[1.1rem] font-semibold italic text-ink">{faq.q}</dt>
            <dd class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted max-w-2xl">{faq.a}</dd>
          </div>
        ))}
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
